<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Direct Debit Setup Complete</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10B981 0%, #059669 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .success-icon {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .mandate-details {
      background: #F0FDF4;
      border-left: 4px solid #10B981;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .mandate-details h2 {
      margin: 0 0 15px 0;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #059669;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D1FAE5;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #064E3B;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #1E293B;
    }
    .info-box {
      background: #EFF6FF;
      border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .info-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      color: #1E40AF;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="success-icon">✓</div>
      <h1>Direct Debit Setup Complete</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{familyName}},</p>

      <p>Thank you for setting up your Direct Debit mandate with {{clubName}}. Your payment method is now active and ready to use.</p>

      <div class="mandate-details">
        <h2>Mandate Details</h2>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Reference Number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{mandateReference}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Setup Date:</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{setupDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Status:</span>
          <span class="detail-value" style="color: #059669; font-weight: 700;">Active</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <h3>What happens next?</h3>
        <p>Your future invoices will be automatically collected via Direct Debit. You'll receive email notifications when:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>A new invoice is created</li>
          <li>A payment is collected</li>
          <li>There are any changes to payment amounts or dates</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p><strong>Important Information:</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>Payments will be collected on or after the invoice due date</li>
        <li>You'll receive at least 3 days' notice before any payment is collected</li>
{{#if isBecs}}
        <li>You can cancel your Direct Debit Request at any time by contacting your bank</li>
        <li>Your payments are protected under the Bulk Electronic Clearing System (BECS) rules and the Direct Debit Request Service Agreement</li>
{{else}}
        <li>You can cancel your Direct Debit at any time by contacting your bank</li>
        <li>All payments are protected by the Direct Debit Guarantee</li>
{{/if}}
      </ul>

      <p>If you need to update your bank details or have any questions about your Direct Debit, please contact us.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Thank you for choosing an easy and convenient way to pay!</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best regards,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Payments are processed securely by GoCardless</p>
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
